WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.040
Let's face it,

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:02.865
A lot of people have changed their

00:00:02.865 --> 00:00:04.660
routines in the last year,

00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.330
they've had too.

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:08.660
People are staying at home,

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:10.710
they're not moving around as much,

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.520
they're not as active.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:13.353
Well, guess what?

00:00:13.353 --> 00:00:15.140
We have a sponsor that has a product

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:18.083
made just for these times.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.750
[Narrator] Bars are still closed.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.430
Concerts are canceled.

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.860
Dance clubs still haven't opened.

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.890
With no reason to stay up all night,

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:30.780
you don't need the stimulation
you get from energy drinks

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:33.700
like Red Bull, Rockstar and Monster.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:38.037
That's why we introduced
Monster Low Energy Drink.

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:40.920
With no caffeine and fewer electrolytes,

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:44.570
Monster Low Energy drink
gives you just enough energy

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:46.940
to stay awake a little longer.

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.672
So you can play that video game,

00:00:48.672 --> 00:00:51.034
do that minor household chore

00:00:51.034 --> 00:00:55.055
and laugh at your bosses
joke during a Zoom call.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.677
(laughing)

00:00:56.677 --> 00:00:59.160
That's, that's funny, Dan.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:00.997
[Narrator] Monster low energy drink.

00:01:00.997 --> 00:01:03.664
(clock ticking)

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.938
What do you think, Andy?

00:01:16.938 --> 00:01:21.570
Oh, I can feel my heart racing
to about its normal rate.

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:24.170
Yeah, mine is just now getting

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:26.730
to 60 beats per minute.

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:28.063
Yeah, it's thrilling.

